cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "CIC-Intents"
abstract: >
  CIC-Intents is the reference implementation for the paper "Channel
  Shortcuts in Italian Multi-Channel Fraud Intent Detection". It
  provides the Italian Fraud Intent Taxonomy (IFIT, 12 multi-label
  intents), the training and evaluation code for the CIC-Intents
  framework (Multi-Label SupCon + kernel MMD + Post-hoc Channel
  Centering), the gradient-based causal attribution procedure
  (PN / PS), and all scripts needed to reproduce the figures and
  tables in the paper.
